repo_flow_graph:
```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph FastAPI Application
        A[main.py (Entrypoint)] --> B(FastAPI Class);
        B --> C(Routing System);
        C --> D{Path Operation Functions};
        D -- Input (Request Data) --> E(Request Body Validation);
        E -- Validated Data --> F(Dependency Injection);
        F --> G{Business Logic};
        G --> H(Response Generation);
        H --> I(Response Serialization);
        I --> J(Return Response);

        subgraph Components
            B -- Uses --> K(APIRouter);
            B -- Uses --> L(Security Utilities);
            C -- Uses --> M(Starlette Routing);
            C -- Uses --> N(Pydantic Models);
            E -- Uses --> N;
            I -- Uses --> N;

        end

        subgraph Data Flow
            D -- Handles --> O(Request Parameters);
            D -- Handles --> P(Query Parameters);
            O -- Validation --> E;
            P -- Validation --> E;

        end
    end

    subgraph External Dependencies
        M -- Uses --> Q(ASGI Server (e.g., Uvicorn));
        N -- Uses --> R(Data Types (e.g., str, int, list));
        L -- Uses --> S(Security Libraries (e.g., OAuth2));

    end

    subgraph Output
        J --> T[HTTP Response (JSON, etc.)];

    end

    style A fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style T fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
```

file_flow_graph.diagram:
```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Start: main.py] --> B{Test with pytest? (use_pytest)};
    B -- Yes --> C[Run pytest command];
    C --> D{Test Passed?};
    D -- Yes --> E[Print pytest success message];
    E --> F[Exit: Success];
    D -- No --> G[Print pytest failure message];
    G --> H[Exit: Failure];

    B -- No --> I{Run with uvicorn reload? (use_uvicorn_reload)};
    I -- Yes --> J[Run uvicorn with reload];
    J --> K{Manual testing required};
    K --> L[Exit: Manual Test needed];
    I -- No --> M{Run uvicorn? (use_uvicorn)};
    M -- Yes --> N[Run uvicorn];
    N --> K;
    M -- No --> O[Print "No testing strategy provided"];
    O --> H;
```
